| End-to-end send/receive | 15 ms | ~67 msg/sec (TCP) |

#### 5.2 Scalability Limits (v5.0.0)
| Metric | Limit | Reasoning |
|--------|-------|-----------|
| Agents | <100 | O(n) registry lookup acceptable |
| Messages/lifetime | 10M+ | Append-only log unbounded |
| Database size | 500GB+ | SQLite grows uncontrolled (v5.1 fixes) |
| Concurrent connections | 50-100 | Tokio async capable, TCP overhead |
| Byzantine quorum | 3 | Odd number for 2/3 majority |

**Future Improvements (v5.2):**
- HashMap registry → O(1) lookup (support 10k agents)
- Async/Tokio optimization → 1000+ concurrent
- Formal Byzantine proof → 10+ agents configurable

