### SECTION 9: DEPLOYMENT SCENARIOS

#### 9.1 Recommended (v5.0.0)
- ✅ **Internal trusted network** (intranet, corporate LAN)
- ✅ **3+ agent quorum** (alice, bob, charlie minimum)
- ✅ **Controlled access** (firewall 127.0.0.1:5050 only)
- ✅ **Audit logging enabled** (default SQLite)
- ✅ **Key management** (centralized, backed up)

**Not recommended without v5.1:**
- ❌ Public internet
- ❌ Multi-organization federation
- ❌ High-frequency messaging (rate limiting needed)
- ❌ Long-term data retention (DB growth uncontrolled)

#### 9.2 Recommended (v5.1+)
- ✅ Cloud-ready (TLS + rate limiting)
- ✅ Federation support (mutual auth + encryption)
- ✅ Enterprise-grade (checkpointing, key encryption)
